# Phase 23 corpus directory — metadata is tracked, the image never is.
#
# D-04: the corpus is operator-supplied and its identity in the verdict is
# release name plus sha256. The binary itself is NEVER committed to this
# repository. These rules exist so that cannot happen by accident.
#
# This file lives inside the evidence tree rather than in the repository root
# .gitignore on purpose: the phase's no-product-code invariant is that
# `git diff --name-only <phase-base>..HEAD` touches only .planning/ and docs/,
# and a root-level edit would break it for no benefit.

# Every binary image form the corpus can arrive as.
*.d64
*.prg
*.bin
*.t64
*.crt
*.zip
*.gz

# Identity and metadata are tracked.
!.gitignore
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.json
